  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity is part of the Health, Ecosystems, and Agriculture for Resilient, Thriving Societies (HEARTH) Global Development Alliances (GDA) and contributes to HEARTH&apos;s overall objectives by supporting robust economic development through tourism, increasing support and financing for local health and natural resource management activities, and reducing the adverse impacts of tourism in a highly biodiverse setting a worldwide activity led by USAID/Washington designed to catalyze solutions that promote the well-being of humans and the environment through cross-sectoral development initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
